---
// Своя векторная схема исторического центра Мюнхена. Без внешних тайлов и скриптов (DSGVO).
// Проекция: равнопромежуточная по широте 48,14°. Схема упрощена, не для навигации.
import { MUNICH } from "../lib/city.js";
const { lang = "ru", id = "map" } = Astro.props;
const B = { w: 11.550, e: 11.598, s: 48.1295, n: 48.1495 };
const W = 1000, K = W / ((B.e - B.w) * 74.27), H = Math.round((B.n - B.s) * 111.2 * K);
const X = (lon) => +((lon - B.w) * 74.27 * K).toFixed(1);
const Y = (lat) => +((B.n - lat) * 111.2 * K).toFixed(1);
const pt = ([lat, lon]) => `${X(lon)},${Y(lat)}`;
const line = (a) => a.map(pt).join(" ");
const RING = [[48.1395,11.5650],[48.1352,11.5668],[48.1335,11.5690],[48.1327,11.5740],[48.1338,11.5790],[48.1350,11.5822],[48.1378,11.5845],[48.1410,11.5850],[48.1432,11.5835],[48.1440,11.5790],[48.1442,11.5735],[48.1430,11.5690],[48.1412,11.5662]];
const ISAR = [[48.1290,11.5812],[48.1320,11.5858],[48.1345,11.5885],[48.1373,11.5918],[48.1405,11.5940],[48.1440,11.5955],[48.1500,11.5978]];
const EIS = [[48.1424,11.5884],[48.1450,11.5893],[48.1475,11.5905],[48.1500,11.5918]];
const EG = [[48.1426,11.5858],[48.1434,11.5900],[48.1460,11.5925],[48.1500,11.5945],[48.1500,11.5848],[48.1470,11.5852],[48.1442,11.5850]];
const HOFG = [[48.1420,11.5780],[48.1438,11.5780],[48.1438,11.5832],[48.1420,11.5832]];
const STREETS = [
  [[48.1402,11.5600],[48.1393,11.5652]], [[48.1391,11.5660],[48.1374,11.5755]], [[48.1425,11.5776],[48.1500,11.5806]],
  [[48.1400,11.5790],[48.1373,11.5918]], [[48.1425,11.5770],[48.1462,11.5640]], [[48.1390,11.5652],[48.1300,11.5662]],
  [[48.1372,11.5765],[48.1350,11.5824]], [[48.1416,11.5500],[48.1410,11.5600]], [[48.1350,11.5824],[48.1325,11.5868]],
  [[48.1440,11.5790],[48.1425,11.5860],[48.1420,11.5960]],
];
const RAIL = [[48.1407,11.5590],[48.1418,11.5545],[48.1428,11.5500]];
const WAY = [[48.1402,11.5600],[48.1393,11.5652],[48.1388,11.5700],[48.1386,11.5736],[48.1374,11.5755],[48.1351,11.5763],[48.1360,11.5786],[48.1376,11.5799],[48.1396,11.5792],[48.1410,11.5788],[48.1423,11.5774],[48.1428,11.5803],[48.1430,11.5842],[48.1435,11.5877]];
const LBL = { ru: { isar: "Изар", eg: "Английский сад", hofg: "Хофгартен", alt: "Старый город", rail: "ж/д", north: "С" }, de: { isar: "Isar", eg: "Englischer Garten", hofg: "Hofgarten", alt: "Altstadt", rail: "Gleise", north: "N" }, en: { isar: "Isar", eg: "English Garden", hofg: "Hofgarten", alt: "Old town", rail: "rail", north: "N" } }[lang];
const SN = [["Ludwigstr.", 48.1470, 11.5781, -73], ["Maximilianstr.", 48.1384, 11.5866, 13], ["Sonnenstr.", 48.1338, 11.5648, -86], ["Bayerstr.", 48.1405, 11.5622, -10]];
const food = Object.values(MUNICH.food).flat().filter((f) => f.k);
const pts = [...MUNICH.route, ...MUNICH.extra];
const lab = { 1: [10, 32], 2: [6, 32], 3: [-14, -20], 4: [-18, 26], 5: [-6, 30], 6: [22, 6], 7: [22, 6], 8: [-26, -14], 9: [6, -20], 10: [0, -22], 11: [0, -20] };
---
<svg class="citymap" id={id} viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label={`${MUNICH.name[lang]}: ${LBL.alt}`} xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <rect class="m-bg" width={W} height={H} />
  <polygon class="m-old" points={line(RING)} />
  <polygon class="m-park" points={line(EG)} />
  <polygon class="m-park" points={line(HOFG)} />
  <polyline class="m-rail" points={line(RAIL)} />
  {STREETS.map((s) => <polyline class="m-road" points={line(s)} />)}
  <polygon class="m-ring" points={line(RING)} />
  <polyline class="m-water" points={line(ISAR)} />
  <polyline class="m-brook" points={line(EIS)} />
  <text class="m-lbl m-lbl-water" x={X(11.5905)} y={Y(48.1330)} transform={`rotate(52 ${X(11.5905)} ${Y(48.1330)})`}>{LBL.isar}</text>
  <text class="m-lbl m-lbl-park" x={X(11.5893)} y={Y(48.1482)} text-anchor="middle">{LBL.eg}</text>
  <text class="m-lbl m-lbl-old" x={X(11.5700)} y={Y(48.1411)} text-anchor="middle">{LBL.alt}</text>
  <text class="m-lbl m-sm" x={X(11.5535)} y={Y(48.1398)}>{LBL.rail}</text>
  {SN.map(([n, la, lo, r]) => <text class="m-street" x={X(lo)} y={Y(la)} text-anchor="middle" transform={`rotate(${r} ${X(lo)} ${Y(la)})`}>{n}</text>)}
  <polyline class="m-route-case" points={line(WAY)} />
  <polyline class="m-route" points={line(WAY)} />
  {food.map((f) => <g class="m-food"><rect x={X(f.ll[1]) - 12} y={Y(f.ll[0]) - 12} width="24" height="24" rx="6" /><text x={X(f.ll[1])} y={Y(f.ll[0]) + 5} text-anchor="middle">{f.k}</text></g>)}
  {pts.map((p) => <g class={p.p === 1 || p.p === 10 ? "m-pt m-end" : p.p === 11 ? "m-pt m-extra" : "m-pt"}><circle cx={X(p.ll[1])} cy={Y(p.ll[0])} r="14" /><text x={X(p.ll[1])} y={Y(p.ll[0]) + 5} text-anchor="middle">{p.p}</text><text class="m-ptl" x={X(p.ll[1]) + lab[p.p][0]} y={Y(p.ll[0]) + lab[p.p][1]} text-anchor={lab[p.p][0] > 10 ? "start" : lab[p.p][0] < -10 ? "end" : "middle"}>{p.name.split(" · ")[0]}</text></g>)}
  <g class="m-north" transform="translate(44 44)"><circle r="22" /><path d="M0 -14 L7 6 L0 2 L-7 6 Z" /><text y="19" text-anchor="middle">{LBL.north}</text></g>
  <g class="m-scale" transform={`translate(24 ${H - 26})`}><rect width={Math.round(K * 0.5)} height="6" /><text y="-6">500 m</text></g>
</svg>
